# For sampling Year 2000 we do not have the previous 4 years worth of rainfall data so ommit this sampling year
# Sampling Year Windows: 
# Year 2005: 2001-2005
# Year 2010: 2006-2010
# Year 2015: 2011-2015
# Year 2023: 2016-2023 longer interval since data site sampling occurred in 2023 
```

